      "title": "Postdoc Position (2 years) in Manufacturing Technology & Industrial Management",
      "description": "The Department of Technology and Innovation (ITI) at University of Southern Denmark (SDU), section of Engineering Operations Management, invites applications for a 2-year position as Postdoc in Manufacturing Technology & Industrial Management.  The position is open from December 1, 2026, and the job location is Odense, Denmark.\n\nThe application deadline is October 15, 2026, at 11:59 PM/23:59 (CET/CEST) ",
