      "title": "Postdoc Position in Materials Chemistry at the Mads Clausen Institute, The University of Southern Denmark in Sønderborg, Denmark",
      "description": "We are seeking an enthusiastic new colleague as a postdoctoral research associate in the field of Materials Chemistry with a strong background, particularly in Solid State Chemistry and (Photo)electrochemistry, and interest in industrial applications and cooperation to join the Mads Clausen Institute (MCI) at the University of Southern Denmark (SDU) in Sønderborg, Denmark. The position is for two years with an expected starting date of 01.03.2027. The application deadline is October 31, 2026 at 11.59 PM/23.59 (CET/CEST).",
      "department": null
    },
    "https://fa-eosd-saasfaprod1.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1001/job/4133": {
      "title": "PhD Position in Material Chemistry at the Mads Clausen Institute – Sønderborg",
      "description": "We are seeking an enthusiastic new colleague as a PhD student in the field of Materials Chemistry with a strong background, particularly in Solid State Chemistry and Crystal Structure Analysis, and interest in industrial applications and cooperation to join the Mads Clausen Institute (MCI) at the University of Southern Denmark (SDU) in Sønderborg, Denmark. The position is for three years with a preferred starting date of March 1, 2027, or as soon as possible. \n\nThe application deadline is October 31, 2026, at 11:59 PM/23:59 (CET/CEST)",
      "department": null
    },
    "https://fa-eosd-saasfaprod1.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1001/job/4192": {
      "title": "Research Assistant in Clinical and Preventive Odontology",
      "description": "Department of Clinical and Preventive Odontology, Faculty of Health Sciences, University of Southern Denmark is seeking a highly motivated individual for a one-year fixed-term appointment as a Research Assistant (up to 37 hours per week). The successful candidate will have the opportunity to contribute to the establishment of the newly established Department of Clinical and Preventive Odontology and to play an active role in the development of the upcoming educational programmes for dentists and dental hygienists. ",
      "department": null
    },
    "https://fa-eosd-saasfaprod1.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1001/job/4193": {
      "title": "Assistant Professors and/or Associate Professors in Clinical and Preventive Odontology",
      "description": "Department of Clinical and Preventive Odontology, Faculty of Health Sciences, University of Southern Denmark is seeking two motivated individuals for two fixed-term appointments (2 years, up to 37 hours per week, with the possibility of extension). The successful candidates will have the opportunity to contribute to the establishment of the newly established Department of Clinical and Preventive Odontology and to play an active role in the development of the upcoming educational programmes for dentists and dental hygienists.",
      "department": null
    },
